# .3md is Markdown with a Z axis. GitHub Linguist treats a leading dot as a
# troff macro and .3* names as man pages, so these files show up as Roff.
# The Markdown preview also joins a single newline into a space and glues the
# planes into one paragraph. Plain text keeps each plane on its own line.
*.3md linguist-language=Text

# Changelog bullets merge by keeping both sides' lines (DRIVE-12).
CHANGELOG.md merge=union

# Markdown bug records merge field by field, with the Log entry by entry
# (`chough bug merge`). The two files `chough library index` generates keep ours
# (`chough library merge`) and are rebuilt (`library index --check` in the verify lane),
# DRIVE-12. Sessions, stories, posts and lessons are separate files, so they merge as
# files; snapshots and briefs are not generated, so they still conflict.
.chough/bugs/*.md merge=chough-bug
knowledge/index.md merge=chough-generated
knowledge/journal/feed.xml merge=chough-generated
